1
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,867
[Feeling great]

2
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:16,333
[Trying to find someone to help him]
(Putting on a mic pack alone isn't easy)

3
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:17,467
Thank you.

4
00:00:19,633 --> 00:00:20,333
Oh, it's hot!

5
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:21,500
(Mic pack) Really hot.

6
00:00:21,867 --> 00:00:24,200
(A mic pack heated up in the summer heat)

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,933
(Moving to the stage)

8
00:00:26,933 --> 00:00:27,933
Let us greet you first.

9
00:00:27,933 --> 00:00:31,567
One Destiny, Drive to the Top.
Hi, we're ALPHA DRIVE ONE.
(Greeting the staff together)

10
00:00:31,567 --> 00:00:33,033
Nice to see you!

11
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:37,000
(After checking the blocking for each song)

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,200
(Sound check rehearsal begins)

13
00:00:45,133 --> 00:00:48,967
(SANGHYEON has trouble with his in-ear)

14
00:00:52,133 --> 00:00:53,933
[Troubleshooting]
Can you hear one side but not the other?

15
00:00:53,933 --> 00:00:55,733
[Troubleshooting]
One side is okay but not the other at all?

16
00:00:55,733 --> 00:00:57,567
(Taking him to the staff)

17
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:01,700
Even at max volume, it's still too quiet.

18
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,533
(LEO is heading back to the stage)

19
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,867
Gather (at the main stage) for the ending.

20
00:01:07,867 --> 00:01:08,733
Coming here?

21
00:01:08,733 --> 00:01:09,767
Okay, got it.

22
00:01:09,767 --> 00:01:11,533
And you're still bunching up.

23
00:01:11,533 --> 00:01:13,233
We can start moving over from the bridge.

24
00:01:13,233 --> 00:01:15,367
Here for 'FORMULA'
and there for 'Cinnamon Shake.'

25
00:01:17,267 --> 00:01:22,800
(The main performance rehearsal follows)

26
00:01:32,733 --> 00:01:36,100
(Mic checking time one by one)

27
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,333
Hi, I'm ANXIN.

28
00:01:37,333 --> 00:01:38,433
Hello X2

29
00:01:38,833 --> 00:01:41,267
Hello X4

30
00:01:42,567 --> 00:01:46,100
Hi, I'm XINLONG X3

31
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:48,767
Hi, I'm ARNO X2

32
00:01:48,767 --> 00:01:49,667
Hi~

33
00:01:49,667 --> 00:01:50,700
(Hello)

34
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:53,067
[Next up is LEO]
Hi~ X2

35
00:01:53,333 --> 00:01:55,300
Keep going keep going up♪

36
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:55,933
Yes, thank you.

37
00:01:55,933 --> 00:01:56,700
SANGHYEON, would you try it?

38
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:58,367
Yes, hello. Ah, ah, ah.

39
00:01:58,367 --> 00:02:01,333
Holding the future
Bursting out the flame inside me♪

40
00:02:01,333 --> 00:02:02,433
Hi~

41
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:05,167
Hi, I'm ALPHA DRIVE ONE JUNSEO.

42
00:02:05,167 --> 00:02:06,567
Nice to see youuu~

43
00:02:06,567 --> 00:02:12,100
The fire in my beating chest, it's you♪

44
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:16,200
(Moving to the extended stage)

45
00:02:16,867 --> 00:02:19,600
(Puppy joins in late after his walk)

46
00:02:22,667 --> 00:02:24,333
[Hahaha]

47
00:02:24,333 --> 00:02:27,133
(A smooth ending)

48
00:02:27,133 --> 00:02:29,600
Let's check the sound on the extended stage.

49
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,400
Okay!

50
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:33,033
[The mic is blasting]
Any problem?

51
00:02:33,033 --> 00:02:34,567
[Flustered]
Oh, it's too loud.

52
00:02:34,567 --> 00:02:37,333
Earlier, my volume
suddenly reset and turned off.

53
00:02:37,333 --> 00:02:38,733
[Blasting]
Well, our...

54
00:02:38,733 --> 00:02:40,567
[Securing the mic]
(Self-volume down)

55
00:02:40,567 --> 00:02:41,200
Let's gather at that time.

56
00:02:42,433 --> 00:02:45,100
(Didn't forget the baby dog's mistake)

57
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:48,033
We stay together for the first verse,
then spread out.

58
00:02:48,033 --> 00:02:49,367
And then let's gather again
for the 1st chorus.

59
00:02:49,367 --> 00:02:51,367
(Blocking complete)

60
00:02:51,367 --> 00:02:53,733
Let's have you, SANGWON, and me
do this part separately.

61
00:02:53,733 --> 00:02:54,733
XINLONG and my rap part too.

62
00:02:54,733 --> 00:02:55,633
Okay~

63
00:02:55,633 --> 00:02:57,400
It needs to be somewhat organized.

64
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:00,333
(Now 'FREAK ALARM' follows)

65
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:17,600
(Wrapping up the rehearsal)

66
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:18,667
(Returning to the waiting room)

67
00:03:18,667 --> 00:03:19,567
Amazing rehearsal.

68
00:03:19,567 --> 00:03:20,167
Wow~

69
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:23,800
[Thanks to the hot Bangkok weather]
I completely... lost all the puffiness

70
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,900
because I've been sweating so hard.

71
00:03:25,367 --> 00:03:27,600
I should use some of my hair and makeup time

72
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,033
to stop by the hotel.

73
00:03:29,433 --> 00:03:30,367
I'm going to wash up and be right back.

74
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,367
[Staring hard]

75
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:34,367
Oh, what...

76
00:03:34,367 --> 00:03:36,233
This outfit matches my hair color exactly, huh?

77
00:03:36,233 --> 00:03:36,933
My hair?

78
00:03:36,933 --> 00:03:40,167
(Carefully selecting today's contacts)

79
00:03:40,167 --> 00:03:41,967
[Duplicated, rejected]
I already wore them yesterday.

80
00:03:41,967 --> 00:03:43,467
[Too uncertain, rejected]
They're pretty, but something feels off.

81
00:03:43,467 --> 00:03:44,933
[Sick of them, rejected]
I'm sick of them now.

82
00:03:44,933 --> 00:03:46,400
(The final pick)

83
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:50,767
Oh!

84
00:03:50,767 --> 00:03:53,433
(They seem right up his alley)

85
00:03:57,700 --> 00:04:00,533
(Disliked hair is rejected too)

86
00:04:01,067 --> 00:04:02,467
[To Performance Director]
Then where were you?

87
00:04:02,467 --> 00:04:05,067
(The flight to Thailand was delayed)

88
00:04:05,067 --> 00:04:06,233
What did you do there?

89
00:04:06,233 --> 00:04:07,367
I didn't do anything, huh?

90
00:04:07,367 --> 00:04:07,900
Until the end?

91
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:08,367
Yes.

92
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:10,267
Did you sleep?

93
00:04:10,267 --> 00:04:11,900
No, I sat still like this

94
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:14,633
but took a nap for 20 minutes
at the end, thinking, 'This isn't good.'

95
00:04:14,633 --> 00:04:16,000
Really just sitting there?

96
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,067
I really sat there like this.

97
00:04:17,067 --> 00:04:19,533
(Just amazing)

98
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,300
(LEO is practicing his comments in Thai hard)

99
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:24,100
(Setlog is a must)

100
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,633
Teumsae~

101
00:04:25,633 --> 00:04:26,367
Ramyun.

102
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:28,067
[Tempted]
Do you have ramyun?

103
00:04:28,067 --> 00:04:29,900
[Without ramyun]
Teumsae Setlog

104
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:32,500
(Making watermelon punch)

105
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,900
Wow, we have this!

106
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:34,933
What?

107
00:04:34,933 --> 00:04:36,100
Don't you know this?

108
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,000
Don't you really know this?

109
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,533
[3rd try]
How do you not know this?

110
00:04:39,367 --> 00:04:41,700
(Not telling us what it is)

111
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:42,500
Ha.Ha.Ha.

112
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:43,933
Don't you really know this?

113
00:04:43,933 --> 00:04:46,333
(A reunion with my favorite snack
that only I know)

114
00:04:46,333 --> 00:04:47,633
How come you don't know this?

115
00:04:48,133 --> 00:04:48,967
[Crunch]

116
00:04:48,967 --> 00:04:50,400
[Savoring it]

117
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,967
(Perfect even for picky-eater LEO)

118
00:04:52,967 --> 00:04:54,300
[Let me tell you what it is]
Ketchup flavor snack!

119
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:57,167
Just hearing the explanation makes you go, 'Eh?'

120
00:04:57,167 --> 00:04:57,533
Delicious.

121
00:04:57,533 --> 00:04:58,600
But it's really delicious.

122
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,067
It's kind of addictive.

123
00:05:00,067 --> 00:05:02,633
You would frown after eating it first.
(LEO's favorite snack PR time)

124
00:05:02,633 --> 00:05:03,667
After eating this whole packet?

125
00:05:03,667 --> 00:05:06,267
You'll order a box of this snack
when you return to Korea.

126
00:05:07,867 --> 00:05:11,967
(After savoring the snack,
starting to savor ANXIN now)

127
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:20,300
(Q. Why are you two so friendly?)

128
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:22,167
[Shocking confession]
We're just acting in front of the camera.

129
00:05:22,167 --> 00:05:22,667
[Hehe]

130
00:05:22,667 --> 00:05:23,833
- We're professional.
- I guess so.

131
00:05:25,433 --> 00:05:26,133
Argh!

132
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,633
(I'll get revenge)

133
00:05:29,033 --> 00:05:30,133
(Running hard)

134
00:05:33,733 --> 00:05:35,067
(HeheCat)

135
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,400
We're in the same style today.

136
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:45,000
The funny thing is that I bought these pants.

137
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:48,133
These are our stylist's pants

138
00:05:48,133 --> 00:05:50,267
and this is a borrowed T-shirt.

139
00:05:50,267 --> 00:05:51,300
Is your T-shirt borrowed?

140
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:52,100
Right?

141
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,267
Borrowed Cat.

142
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:59,000
(Borrowed Rabbit is still lost in 'Beautiful')

143
00:06:01,533 --> 00:06:07,000
[SANGWON's photo card]
I slipped it in on SANGWON's Romance Day.

144
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,433
It feels a bit off to take it out now...

145
00:06:09,433 --> 00:06:11,633
(It's time for soundcheck)

146
00:06:12,567 --> 00:06:14,500
(A lot cuter LEO appears)

147
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:20,500
(Still filming the setlog
on the way to the stage)

148
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:23,167
(Such a diligent setlog creator)

149
00:06:23,167 --> 00:06:24,533
I've completed the setlog.

150
00:06:27,767 --> 00:06:29,700
(Checking the greetings in Thai)

151
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:31,733
(Putting on the in-ear too)

152
00:06:31,733 --> 00:06:34,367
(Time for the soundcheck
enjoying the Jaemnyang time)

153
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,467
Hi~

154
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:40,467
(Soundcheck begins)

155
00:07:04,533 --> 00:07:06,633
(The fans' energy is as hot as the weather)

156
00:07:06,633 --> 00:07:08,100
ARNO, would you say something?

157
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:11,900
We'll show you
all of ALPHA DRIVE ONE's charm today.

158
00:07:11,900 --> 00:07:13,033
Please look forward to it!

159
00:07:13,033 --> 00:07:14,767
(The flirting has already started)

160
00:07:14,767 --> 00:07:18,367
(The next song is 'FREAK ALARM')

161
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,167
(Striding in)

162
00:07:26,467 --> 00:07:28,767
(Striding in 22)

163
00:07:36,567 --> 00:07:39,533
(Wrapped up the soundcheck happily)

164
00:07:40,933 --> 00:07:42,767
(Sensing something's off)

165
00:07:42,767 --> 00:07:43,800
Did someone forget to return their mic pack?

166
00:07:44,833 --> 00:07:45,900
Huh?

167
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:46,600
[Passing it forward]
ANXIN!

168
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,033
[Passing it forward]
Huh?

169
00:07:47,033 --> 00:07:48,500
Anyone who forgot to return the pack?

170
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:50,067
(A rabbit is the culprit)

171
00:07:50,933 --> 00:07:54,000
We just finished the soundcheck.

172
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,533
The reaction was really great!

173
00:07:55,533 --> 00:07:58,333
The fans were so passionate,

174
00:07:58,333 --> 00:08:02,633
even in this heat, they cheered so loudly.

175
00:08:02,633 --> 00:08:04,233
Thank you so much.

176
00:08:04,233 --> 00:08:06,100
Actually, I wanted...

177
00:08:06,100 --> 00:08:08,500
[Suddenly]
I want some durians in Thailand.

178
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,833
[Dumbfounded]
Didn't you talk about the show?

179
00:08:09,833 --> 00:08:10,667
[Oops]

180
00:08:11,167 --> 00:08:12,000
[Tantrum]
Aaaaahhh!

181
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,833
[Giving in]
You want some durians, huh?

182
00:08:12,833 --> 00:08:13,367
Yes.

183
00:08:13,367 --> 00:08:15,800
[A reliable leader]
Let's have some if we have a chance.

184
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,200
Good.

185
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:19,567
Well, I knew it

186
00:08:19,567 --> 00:08:21,967
but Thai fans' reaction was really great.

187
00:08:21,967 --> 00:08:24,867
[During the soundcheck]
They enjoyed it passionately.

188
00:08:24,867 --> 00:08:28,900
[More excitement for the main show]
So, I think we can enjoy the performance better.

189
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:30,800
We'll do our best for the main show!

190
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,333
See you later.

191
00:08:31,333 --> 00:08:32,133
Bye!

192
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,400
During the self-introduction just now...

193
00:08:34,167 --> 00:08:34,900
Mr. ANXIN~

194
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:36,333
- Ah, really!
- When did you change your name?

195
00:08:36,333 --> 00:08:37,033
I was just...

196
00:08:37,033 --> 00:08:39,033
Why did you do that? I'm curious.

197
00:08:39,033 --> 00:08:40,267
[Scratching]
Well, I was just...

198
00:08:40,267 --> 00:08:41,800
[Scratching]
'Hi, I'm ANX...'

199
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:44,933
[LONGuage system error]
Just... My brain didn't switch the languages.

200
00:08:44,933 --> 00:08:46,100
Ah~ It wasn't built in.

201
00:08:46,433 --> 00:08:47,700
- Suddenly...
- From now on, I will be!

202
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:49,333
After hearing ANXIN's greeting...

203
00:08:49,833 --> 00:08:52,133
(He just copied ANXIN's greeting)

204
00:08:52,133 --> 00:08:54,400
Since the greeting (in Thai)
wasn't familiar to you already.

205
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:55,167
Yes, that's right.

206
00:08:55,167 --> 00:08:56,300
I'll be XINLONG from now on.

207
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,500
It's my honor.

208
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,133
[Don't know what to do]
Haha~ Can I be XINLONG?!

209
00:09:01,133 --> 00:09:04,033
(Twin-look brothers return)

210
00:09:04,033 --> 00:09:06,167
[Shower time]
We'll just drop by the hotel.

211
00:09:06,167 --> 00:09:09,833
We're wearing a similar style by accident.

212
00:09:09,833 --> 00:09:11,500
Even our hair colors are similar too.

213
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:14,200
How was today's soundcheck?

214
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,267
It was a blast

215
00:09:15,267 --> 00:09:16,500
and the fans' energy was really intense.

216
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:17,667
- Oh, really.
- It was hotter than the weather.

217
00:09:17,667 --> 00:09:20,767
It's not the weather that's hot,
it's the atmosphere, I think.

218
00:09:20,767 --> 00:09:21,933
That's why we sweat a lot.

219
00:09:21,933 --> 00:09:22,767
The atmosphere was great.

220
00:09:23,267 --> 00:09:24,700
So, I'm looking forward to the main show.

221
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:27,400
Yes, I'm also looking forward
to our main performance so much.

222
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:31,400
We're saving all our energy
to show it in the main show.

223
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,767
See you later, fighting!

224
00:09:34,267 --> 00:09:35,300
(The soundcheck was) Fun.

225
00:09:39,233 --> 00:09:41,733
(JUNSEO is moved by Kimchi Jjigae)

226
00:09:41,733 --> 00:09:44,233
I can enjoy rice only with this, huh?

227
00:09:44,233 --> 00:09:46,533
(Having a bite of meat too)

228
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:50,767
(Fueling up for the main performance)

229
00:09:53,667 --> 00:09:56,400
(Moments later, foodie bot ARNO activates)

230
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,333
(Today's snacks: watermelon & mango rice)

231
00:10:00,067 --> 00:10:01,700
(Delicious)

232
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:04,133
(Hairdresser LONG is here to finish up the hair)

233
00:10:06,133 --> 00:10:09,567
(Lizard LONG's touch
keeps fussing over the back of his hair)

234
00:10:09,567 --> 00:10:10,500
[Charismatic]
The blow dryer.

235
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:13,067
(Hairdresser LONG has seen it all)

236
00:10:13,067 --> 00:10:15,000
(First, the blow dryer ON)

237
00:10:16,633 --> 00:10:18,500
[Smoothly]

238
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:19,867
(Neatly tucking away the tail comb)

239
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:23,733
(Customer No. 1 can't stop laughing)

240
00:10:23,733 --> 00:10:26,100
[Thank you for your understanding
as the camera may lose focus]
(Even trying the hair iron)

241
00:10:26,100 --> 00:10:27,467
[Hmm...]

242
00:10:27,467 --> 00:10:30,533
(Staring hard...)

243
00:10:30,533 --> 00:10:31,700
Nothing I need to do, huh?

244
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:34,467
(Hairdresser LONG just gave it
the finishing touch with the hair iron)

245
00:10:34,467 --> 00:10:36,167
[The never-ending final touch]
Okay, I'll finish it up for now.

246
00:10:36,167 --> 00:10:36,933
Hahargh~

247
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:37,933
Hargh!

248
00:10:37,933 --> 00:10:40,367
(The customer is cracking up)

249
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,833
[Haha]

250
00:10:45,833 --> 00:10:47,067
(The left)

251
00:10:47,067 --> 00:10:48,133
(The right)

252
00:10:48,133 --> 00:10:49,200
(And the front is perfect)

253
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:50,400
[Meaning he loves it]
Not.Bad

254
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,900
[Review management]
Give me that Five stars, Bro~

255
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:52,933
[No, he won't]
Hahaha~

256
00:10:52,933 --> 00:10:54,000
(The next customer is here)

257
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,400
[Rummaging]
(The next customer is here)

258
00:10:57,500 --> 00:10:59,100
This is your hairstyle.

259
00:10:59,100 --> 00:10:59,500
Huh?

260
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,067
This lightning hairstyle is yours.

